Z||000005||Jaygee79||03-01-2001||11:19 AM||||No flames, just a few things I wanted to mention.<P>- There is only one kind of Christian<P>- (This is not directed at anyone in particular, just an overall statement)  It seems to me that those who do not believe in a higher being are just as close-minded as those who do.  (This goes back to the point about how one should be open to changing their 'beliefs')  They tell those who believe that they should be open-minded to the evidence that science provides, and yet they refuse to be open-minded to there being a divine creator.  Seems to me one should practice what they preach.||||reg||1
